                                <span class="badge-mono">THE PARADIGM</span>
                                <h3 class="headline-sm">Intent to Representation</h3>
                                <p class="body-md">
                                    Enabling engineering knowledge, physical reasoning, and B-Rep geometry to exist within the same computational loop.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="tag-footer">GEOMETRIC INTELLIGENCE</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

